        19,
        20
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Butler%2C_Alabama",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Alabama, Tennessee and Northern Railroad reached Butler in 1912, spurring growth and connecting the town to regional trade.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
