      ],
      "source": "https://encyclopediaofalabama.org/article/butler/",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Butler’s historic courthouse and the nearby Zack Rogers House are listed on the Alabama Register of Landmarks and Heritage.",
